@heading h-problema
text: The agent forgets, and when it remembers it cannot say where from
level: 1

Every session starts from zero. Project decisions live in chats, PDFs and spreadsheets; the agent repeats them wrong or invents them with confidence, with no source and no date. Pasting context by hand every session does not scale, and the copy goes stale.
@@

@image im-cuaderno
src: assets/img/cuaderno-1600.webp
alt: Open notebook with blank pages next to pens and a ruler on a desk
credito: Kelly Sikkema
title: Write it once, in plain text.
formato: banda
@@

@features f-como
title: How we solve it
item: **A text file made of blocks.** Every fact, task or step has a stable id. The agent cites `decisions.lnd#d-14`, not «something I read».
item: **Verified is visibly different from assumed.** Every claim carries its mark and its source.
item: **Your Git is the source of truth.** If you leave, you already have the files. The agent's changes arrive as pull requests you accept.
@@

